{"sha": "f842519c2101815d33e3eedb46c2ba9ad8cf2ed47695df9e44b02a368d92b4fd", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:scal:11}", "\\emph{1.} 由于 $I$ 为中点，$\\vect{IB} = -\\vect{IA}$，且", "$IA = 2$。于是", "\\[", "\\vect{MA}\\cdot\\vect{MB}", "= (\\vect{MI} + \\vect{IA})\\cdot(\\vect{MI} - \\vect{IA})", "= \\norm{\\vect{MI}}^2 - \\norm{\\vect{IA}}^2", "= MI^2 - 4 .", "\\]", "", "\\emph{2.} 条件 $\\vect{MA}\\cdot\\vect{MB} = 12$ 化为", "$MI^2 = 16$，即 $MI = 4$：所求集合为以 $I$ 为圆心的", "半径为 $4$ 的圆。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g11:scal:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\vec u \\cdot \\vec v = -3 + 8 = 5$；", "$\\norm{\\vec u} = 5$，$\\norm{\\vec v} = \\sqrt5$；", "$\\cos\\theta = \\frac{5}{5\\sqrt5} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt5}$：", "$\\theta \\approx 63.4^\\circ$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $6 - 4k = 0$：$k = \\frac32$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $W = 50 \\times 10 \\times \\cos 60^\\circ = 250$", "焦耳：只有沿运动方向的分量做功。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $c^2 = 25 + 49 - 2 \\times 35 \\times \\frac12 = 39$：", "$c = \\sqrt{39}$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $\\cos\\gamma = \\frac{16 + 36 - 64}{2 \\times 4", "\\times 6} = -\\frac14$：结果为负，故该角为钝角：", "$\\gamma \\approx 104.5^\\circ$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 由坐标计算：$\\vec u \\cdot \\vec v = \\cos a \\cos b +", "\\sin a \\sin b$。几何法：两个单位向量，", "$\\vec u \\cdot \\vec v = 1 \\times 1 \\times \\cos(a - b)$。", "同一数的两种计算结果相等：", "$\\cos(a - b) = \\cos a \\cos b + \\sin a \\sin b$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $\\cos(a + b) = \\cos(a - (-b)) = \\cos a \\cos(-b) +", "\\sin a \\sin(-b) = \\cos a \\cos b - \\sin a \\sin b$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $\\sin(a + b) = \\cos\\left(\\frac\\pi2 - a - b\\right)", "= \\cos\\left(\\left(\\frac\\pi2 - a\\right) - b\\right)", "= \\cos\\left(\\frac\\pi2 - a\\right)\\cos b +", "\\sin\\left(\\frac\\pi2 - a\\right)\\sin b", "= \\sin a \\cos b + \\cos a \\sin b$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $\\cos 15^\\circ = \\cos 45^\\circ \\cos 30^\\circ +", "\\sin 45^\\circ \\sin 30^\\circ = \\frac{\\sqrt2}{2} \\cdot", "\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2} + \\frac{\\sqrt2}{2} \\cdot \\frac12 =", "\\frac{\\sqrt6 + \\sqrt2}{4} \\approx 0.966$。又", "$\\sin 75^\\circ = \\cos 15^\\circ$：数值相同。", "", "\\textbf{10.} 在第 7 题和第 8 题中取 $b = a$：", "$\\cos 2a = \\cos^2 a - \\sin^2 a = 2\\cos^2 a - 1 = 1 - 2\\sin^2 a$", "（利用 $\\cos^2 + \\sin^2 = 1$），且", "$\\sin 2a = 2 \\sin a \\cos a$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} $\\sin^2 15^\\circ = \\frac{1 - \\cos 30^\\circ}{2}", "= \\frac{2 - \\sqrt3}{4}$，故", "$\\sin 15^\\circ = \\frac{\\sqrt{2 - \\sqrt3}}{2}$。将", "$\\frac{\\sqrt6 - \\sqrt2}{4}$ 平方：", "$\\frac{6 - 2\\sqrt{12} + 2}{16} = \\frac{8 - 4\\sqrt3}{16} =", "\\frac{2 - \\sqrt3}{4}$：同一个数的两种写法。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $\\vect{AP}$ 可分解为沿 $d$ 方向的一部分", "（与 $\\vec n$ 数量积为零）及垂直于 $d$ 的另一部分，其", "长度即所求距离；与单位法向量", "$\\frac{\\vec n}{\\norm{\\vec n}}$ 作数量积，消去第一部分，", "并度量第二部分。设 $A$ 在 $d$ 上：", "$\\vect{AP} \\cdot \\vec n = a x_0 + b y_0 - (a x_A + b y_A) =", "a x_0 + b y_0 + c$，由此得公式。例如：", "$\\frac{\\abs{15 + 24 - 12}}{5} = \\frac{27}{5} = 5.4$。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 半径 $= 5.4$：", "$(x - 5)^2 + (y - 6)^2 = 29.16$。", "", "\\textbf{14.} 距离 $= \\frac{\\abs{-12}}{5} = 2.4$。垂足：过原点的", "垂线为 $(3t, 4t)$；代入直线：", "$9t + 16t = 12$，$t = \\frac{12}{25}$：垂足为", "$\\left(\\frac{36}{25}, \\frac{48}{25}\\right)$，距原点的距离为", "$5t = \\frac{60}{25} = 2.4$。公式与", "直接计算结果一致。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 底 $AB = 6$，高 $=$ 点 $C$ 到", "直线 $(AB)$（即横轴 $y = 0$）：$5$；面积为 $15$。直线 $(AC)$：", "$5x - 2y = 0$，且", "$\\operatorname{dist}(B, (AC)) = \\frac{\\abs{30}}{\\sqrt{29}}$；", "于是 $\\frac12 \\times AC \\times \\frac{30}{\\sqrt{29}} =", "\\frac12 \\times \\sqrt{29} \\times \\frac{30}{\\sqrt{29}} = 15$：", "面积相同，取哪条高均可。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $\\operatorname{dist} = \\frac{\\abs{2 + 1 - 6}}", "{\\sqrt2} = \\frac{3}{\\sqrt2} \\approx 2.12 > 2$：直线", "与圆相离 --- 即无公共点。", "", "\\textbf{17.} 引入 $I$：", "$\\vect{MA} \\cdot \\vect{MB} = (\\vect{MI} + \\vect{IA}) \\cdot", "(\\vect{MI} + \\vect{IB}) = MI^2 + \\vect{MI} \\cdot (\\vect{IA} +", "\\vect{IB}) + \\vect{IA} \\cdot \\vect{IB}$。中间项消去", "（$\\vect{IA} + \\vect{IB} = \\vec 0$），且", "$\\vect{IA} \\cdot \\vect{IB} = -IA^2 = -\\frac{AB^2}{4}$", "（长度为 $\\frac{AB}2$ 的相反向量）。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $\\vect{MA} \\cdot \\vect{MB} = 0 \\iff MI^2 =", "\\frac{AB^2}{4} \\iff MI = \\frac{AB}{2}$：圆心为", "$I$，半径为 $\\frac{AB}2$ 的圆 --- 即以", "$[AB]$ 为直径的圆。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 以 $H$ 为起点展开每一对（$\\vect{BC} =", "\\vect{HC} - \\vect{HB}$，等）：", "\\[", "\\vect{HA} \\cdot \\vect{HC} - \\vect{HA} \\cdot \\vect{HB}", "+ \\vect{HB} \\cdot \\vect{HA} - \\vect{HB} \\cdot \\vect{HC}", "+ \\vect{HC} \\cdot \\vect{HB} - \\vect{HC} \\cdot \\vect{HA} = 0 :", "\\]", "两两相消 --- 此恒等式", "对\\emph{任意}四点均成立。对于我们的 $H$，前两个数量积", "依题设均为零，故", "$\\vect{HC} \\cdot \\vect{AB} = 0$：$H$ 在", "过 $C$ 的高上。三条高交于一点。", "", "\\textbf{20.} 加法公式来自对同一数量积的两种计算：", "一种取\\emph{坐标}形式，另一种取", "\\emph{模与夹角}形式；距离公式来自", "\\emph{投影}形式；垂心的存在性来自", "\\emph{双线性}（沙勒关系与展开）形式。同一量计算两次，", "两式相等，便得一条定理 --- 此即数量积的", "全部本领。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}